  messages:
  - delayBeforeMessage: 0.25
    text: Omg, I'm so happy that you got accepted into the university! Are you exited?
  - delayBeforeMessage: 2
    text: I have sent you a gift of 15000 SEK to help you get settled.
  - delayBeforeMessage: 1
    text: Do you have a home insurance yet? It might be good to have in case something
      would happen.
  - delayBeforeMessage: 3
    text: Anyway, good luck with your studies! Love you xxx
